From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AltarsCN <337293323+Altars3668@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 14:41:08 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] iphlpapi: Implement the MIB change notifications,
 NotifyStableUnicastIpAddressTable and GetIpNetEntry2.

One thread waits on the NSI notifications and tells each registration
row by row what was deleted, added and changed in the tables it
watches.  As on Windows 11 the initial notification comes on the
registering thread before the call returns, once per address family,
but the connectivity hint's comes later on the thread.  Cancelling waits
for the registration's running callbacks unless called from one.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

